BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Exoplanets</h1>
The planets of the Solar System's neighbours (Utils/ExoKit): their periods,
a transit of TRAPPIST-1 e seen from the Sun, tidal locking, the procedural
ground of TRAPPIST-1 e (its seas), and a delta-glider standing on it.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 61000.0
  Script Tests/ExoplanetTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-E
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-E
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-E:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed TRAPPIST-1 e
  POS -28.6479000 -22.9183000
  HEADING 90.00
  AROT 0 0 0
END
END_SHIPS
